# Backend (multi-module)

Read `docs/BACKEND_ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/adr/0007-modular-backend-services.md`.

## Modules

- One bounded context = one `*-service` Spring Boot module (e.g. `activity-log-service`).
- `dashboard-bff` composes Overview; no domain aggregates in BFF.
- Shared: `platform-common`, `platform-security` only.

## Spec-first

- Edit `docs/api/<service>.openapi.yaml` before controllers in that module.
- No Activity Log controllers in `budget-service` or BFF domain packages.

## DDD (inside each service)

- `domain` → `application` → `infrastructure` → `api`
- No cross-service domain imports.

## Commands

```bash
./mvnw -pl activity-log-service test
./mvnw -pl dashboard-bff spring-boot:run
```

## Identity

- JWT `sub` only — never body `userId`.
